--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
u4 (DUT)                                    u5 (SWITCH_A)
  interface vlan3                             interface vlan40
   ip address 10.10.30.1/27                    ip address 10.10.40.2/30
   ip directed-broadcast                      interface vlan50
  interface vlan40                             ip address 10.10.50.1/27
   ip address 10.10.40.1/30                   ip route 10.10.30.0/27 10.10.40.1
  interface port1.0.2                         interface port2.0.24
   switchport trunk allowed vlan add 3         switchport trunk allowed vlan add 40,50
  interface port1.0.24
   switchport trunk allowed vlan add 40
  ip route 10.10.50.0/27 10.10.40.2

